codex
The loop lemma itself closes with `#Top`. K does not automatically reuse that proved reachability claim as a rewrite lemma in a separately selected theorem, so I’m packaging the same proved invariant in a second proof module and checking the top-level theorem against that module. This keeps the dependency explicit: first prove the summary from the unmodified MPY semantics, then prove the function contract using only that verified summary.
